WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.130
That feeling of 
being terrified

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.788
is your&nbsp;invitation 
to create change.

00:00:05.245 --> 00:00:06.927
You have to acknowledge 
those feelings,

00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:08.318
you have to brave&nbsp;them,

00:00:08.318 --> 00:00:10.020
and you have to fight 
to move forward.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.857
It won't be easy.

00:00:12.418 --> 00:00:13.813
You will be afraid.

00:00:14.173 --> 00:00:15.448
Your voice will shake.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.554
But what I can 
absolutely&nbsp;promise you

00:00:18.969 --> 00:00:21.471
is that it will 
be worth it.

